f  medical office of the Scotland says  points to study evidence of low sense of  control self self efficacy and self  esteem in populations in these areas  colleagues at a university like this one  with a distinguished tradition and a  medical school as I've heard I think  three times in the last 12 hours with  the highest NIH income per faculty  member of  University in the United States so with  a deservedly proud tradition we have to  think about how we can use science and  the best interest of promoting the  health of populations and reducing  inequalities in health and I come back  to why we called English review fair  society healthy lives  put fairness at the heart of all  decision making and health will improve  and health inequalities will diminish I  think what we're trying to achieve is  conditions in which individuals and  communities have control over their  lives and participate fully in society
 

